---
layout: base.njk
title: Manage
permalink: /manage/
---
<p class="eyebrow">Your notebook</p>
<h1>Make a note.</h1>
<p>Write and edit in GitHub. Only people with write access to the repository can publish changes.</p>
{% set postTemplate = "---\ntitle: A new note\n---\n\nWrite your thoughts here.\n" %}
<div class="actions">
  <a class="button" href="{{ site.repo }}/new/{{ site.branch }}/src/posts?value={{ postTemplate | urlencode }}">New post ↗</a>
  <a href="{{ site.repo }}/edit/{{ site.branch }}/src/index.md">Edit About ↗</a>
  <a href="{{ site.repo }}/upload/{{ site.branch }}/src/assets">Upload photos ↗</a>
</div>
<p class="hint">Name your post <code>YYYY-MM-DD-short-title.md</code>, change its title, and write below the second <code>---</code> line. Choose <strong>Commit changes</strong> and commit directly to <strong>{{ site.branch }}</strong> to publish. Updates usually appear within a few minutes.</p>
<p class="hint">For photos, upload a JPG, PNG, GIF, or WebP with a simple filename such as <code>kyoto.jpg</code>, then add <code>![Sunset in Kyoto](/assets/kyoto.jpg)</code> to your post. Resize large photos before uploading so pages load quickly.</p>
<p class="hint">To update your profile, choose <strong>Edit About</strong>. Set <code>photo</code> to your uploaded image's path, such as <code>/assets/profile.jpg</code>, add your social links under <code>socials</code>, and write your blurb below the second <code>---</code> line.</p>
<h2>Published notes</h2>
{% if collections.posts | length %}
  <ul class="manage-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title | escape }}</a>
        <span class="post-actions">
          <a href="{{ site.repo }}/edit/{{ site.branch }}/{{ post.inputPath | githubPath }}" aria-label="Edit {{ post.data.title | escape }}">Edit ↗</a>
          <a href="{{ site.repo }}/delete/{{ site.branch }}/{{ post.inputPath | githubPath }}" aria-label="Delete {{ post.data.title | escape }}">Delete ↗</a>
        </span>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p class="hint">Delete opens GitHub's confirmation page. Commit the deletion to remove a note from this site. Its earlier versions remain in Git history.</p>
{% else %}
  <p class="muted">Your notes will appear here after you publish one.</p>
{% endif %}
